WEBVTT

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.560
Morning.

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:10.830
My, you're up early.

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:12.990
I couldn't stay asleep.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:17.070
Honey, take a look at this.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.330
This is from when we got married.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:22.200
It came out when I was 
cleaning out the drawers.

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:24.010
I'm so young.

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:26.080
I'm pretty cute, don't you think?

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:28.700
You're still cute, honey.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:31.420
Oh, stop.

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:36.020
It's like I'm in a dream, 
being married to you, Ai-chan.

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:37.870
Oh, Shugo-kun.

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:38.870
Ai-chan.

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:39.980
Shugo-kun.

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:40.880
Ai-chan!

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:41.700
Shugo-kun!

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:42.600
Ai-chan!

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:47.480
Oh, crap!

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:50.980
Hey, Onee-chan, did you...

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:52.010
Not right now.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:53.380
I'm running late.

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:54.070
Ow.

00:00:55.770 --> 00:00:56.670
Huh?

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:58.740
You quit your club, didn't you?

00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:01.960
It was the yearbook committee 
meeting this morning.

00:01:03.770 --> 00:01:05.210
See you.

00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:07.250
Onee-chan!

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:11.700
What's wrong, Minoa?

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:15.510
D-Did you just see her face...

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:27.120
Hey!

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:31.020
Jeez.

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:33.490
Yuicching!

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:06.580
Their faces changed?

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:09.890
Yeah, although it didn't last for long.

00:03:09.890 --> 00:03:12.460
They changed? How?

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:14.130
How?

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:18.830
Oh, they looked really flat, 
like in an old anime.

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:23.580
You must be tired, Minoa.

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:27.130
A lot has happened since the school festival.

00:03:27.130 --> 00:03:28.580
Please believe me!

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:29.760
I swear...

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:35.240
Morning.

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:37.940
Y-Yui-chan!

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.270
Aren't they weird?

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:40.080
Weird?

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:41.240
Their faces!

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:43.370
How rude.

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:44.290
What about them?

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:45.460
What?!

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:46.870
Can't you tell?

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:48.880
Huh?

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:53.800
First class is art.

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.390
We need to switch classrooms.

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.440
Come on, let's go.

00:03:58.440 --> 00:03:59.380
Okay.

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:04.990
What?

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:06.040
What the hell?

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:08.270
What?

00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:09.520
Are you okay?

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:11.050
What's wrong?

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:13.390
Did you just see that?

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:16.920
That black thing.

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:19.700
The dark abyss, engulfing all creation.

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:23.280
Hell, hell, hell, or something!

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:25.350
Get a grip, Minoa.

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:26.990
There's nothing there.

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:28.310
There was!

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:30.230
You walk up to about here, and...

00:04:30.230 --> 00:04:30.910
Huh?

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:31.960
Huh?

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:33.910
Huh?

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:37.650
Did you eat something weird?

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:40.540
Minoa's seeing things that we can't see.

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:42.010
Shall we go to the nurse's office?

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:45.180
No, I swear, I saw it.

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:48.070
Wait...

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:11.600
I'm so hungry.

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:16.270
Minoa, what are you doing for lunch?

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:16.940
Packed lunch?

00:05:16.940 --> 00:05:18.080
Want to go buy bread?

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:20.590
Lunch B is chicken katsu.

00:05:21.350 --> 00:05:23.090
That sounds good, too.

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:26.090
Minoa, we're having a club 
meeting during lunch.

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.640
That was definitely weird.

00:05:28.670 --> 00:05:31.290
Class just ended instantly.

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:35.540
No way.

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:39.480
It's only been a little more than 
a minute since the first class.

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:42.480
Calm your nerves with some of this.

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:43.480
Sebas.

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:45.770
A maid?

00:05:45.770 --> 00:05:46.610
Bring me the usual.

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:48.040
Understood.

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:49.250
Leave it to me.

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:50.490
She spoke!

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:54.650
S'il vous plaît.

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:56.780
Excelsior, Sebas.

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:00.890
Splendid footwork, Sebas-chan.

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:02.820
Would you like to join the track club?

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:06.640
Here.

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:08.010
Lucky.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.200
Can I have some?

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:11.370
Sure.

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:12.590
Thank you.

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:14.780
Me, too, then.

00:06:17.530 --> 00:06:19.520
Sparkly eyes!

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:22.980
What did you take?

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:27.020
Minoa, you're right.

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:28.150
Something's wrong.

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:29.660
You finally get it?

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:33.500
Sebas serves Earl Grey this time of the day.

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:35.290
This is Houjicha.

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:36.910
<i>That</i>?

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:38.290
<i>That's</i> what's wrong?

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:39.790
<b>Anime Club</b>

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:43.330
About the club president for next year...

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:44.910
This is wrong!

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:46.700
How is it wrong?

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:49.470
Every club is talking about 
the transition right now.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:51.230
I'm not talking about that.

00:06:51.230 --> 00:06:53.960
I mean, everything's gone sideways.

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:55.090
Everything has?

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:58.060
Minoa's been like this all day.

00:06:58.320 --> 00:06:59.380
Weird?

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:01.020
What is <i>weird</i>?

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.740
<i>That's</i> weird!

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:06.140
Are you seeing something, Minoa-chan?

00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:08.430
You must have acquired the 
power of the evil eye.

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:09.820
I have not!

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:13.300
Haven't you noticed everything's changed?

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:14.690
Has it?

00:07:14.690 --> 00:07:16.390
I suppose it has.

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:19.350
Well, now that you mention it...

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:22.580
The series composition might have changed.

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:24.520
The series composition?

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:25.390
No way.

00:07:25.390 --> 00:07:26.710
Now, of all times?

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.590
Did Tahiro run away?

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:32.470
Would it matter that much that he's gone?

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:33.900
What? What?

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:34.970
What are you talking about?

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:37.470
This calls for confirmation.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:40.220
Want to watch the opening again, then?

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:41.230
Agreed.

00:07:41.550 --> 00:07:42.900
Opening?

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:43.980
Again?

00:07:44.250 --> 00:07:45.660
I'm going to rewind.

00:07:57.560 --> 00:07:58.950
Yuicching!

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:29.860
<b>Series Composition      Hirota Mitsutaka</b>

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:29.240
It's still him.

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:32.060
Wait, what's going on?

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:34.160
Why are you all okay with this?

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:36.300
Calm down, Minoa.

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:40.050
Jump the shark too much now, 
and they'll cancel us at Episode 11.

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:41.490
Cancel us at Episode 11?

00:08:41.490 --> 00:08:43.910
Because it's too different from 
what's been happening so far?

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:47.000
They'll accuse us of not sticking to a genre.

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:50.380
What genre will make them happy?

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:51.370
Slice-of-life?

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:52.130
School?

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:52.770
Moe?

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:53.950
Otome?

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:57.720
Genre classifications are becoming 
more and more complicated by the year.

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:02.120
We may need to at least settle on whether 
it's a gag show or a realistic show.

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:04.770
Then it's time to explode.

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:06.150
Explode?

00:09:06.380 --> 00:09:08.660
Anti-flash, anti-blast.

00:09:16.970 --> 00:09:18.880
See, now it's comedy.

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:20.530
My eyes... My eyes!

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:26.670
And this is if we're realistic.

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.380
Yet we're alive.

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:31.420
It's not fully realistic.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:34.170
What would happen if it were?

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:37.770
Let's do it.

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:44.060
You better buy me mackerel sashimi.

00:09:53.060 --> 00:09:54.570
Neko-senpai!

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:56.700
It's realistic.

00:09:56.920 --> 00:09:58.070
It's definitely realistic.

00:09:58.330 --> 00:09:59.450
Realism...

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:00.820
...is amazing.

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:03.330
Neko-senpai!

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:07.000
Neko-senpai!

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:12.000
<b>Our Friend Kouki's Second Betrayal</b>

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:21.770
Are you all right?

00:10:21.770 --> 00:10:23.910
I thought I was dead.

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:27.390
Minoa-chan, are you not going home yet?

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:31.020
I wanted to talk to Neko-senpai some more.

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:32.590
All right.

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:36.650
You've been overreacting today, 
so I was a bit worried.

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:39.050
Sorry.

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:43.780
<i>Everyone's totally decided 
that I'm the weird one.</i>

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:44.960
See you.

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:47.680
Aurora-senpai.

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:49.970
Aurora-senpai?

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:54.170
Nakano-senpai?

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:55.050
Yes?

00:10:56.090 --> 00:10:57.800
U-Um...

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:01.550
You said you had five siblings, right?

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:02.050
Huh?

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:03.550
Oh, yeah.

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:07.840
Is your oldest brother a lot older than you?

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:10.810
Say, by 20 years.

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:12.840
Not at all.

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:13.810
Why?

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:17.570
Oh, never mind, then.

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:18.810
Sorry.

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:20.260
See you.

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:32.720
What's this about his siblings?

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:35.520
Nah, it's nothing.

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:51.100
I'm home.

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:56.110
Welcome home.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:58.300
It looked like it was raining earlier.

00:11:58.300 --> 00:11:59.620
Were you okay?

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:01.120
You're home late.

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:04.240
Sorry, we already watched the 
recording of <i>Tennen Maid</i>.

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:07.350
Mii-chan?

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:08.990
I-I'm home.

00:12:12.650 --> 00:12:14.380
Thank goodness.

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:15.880
What's wrong?

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:17.880
You're such a silly girl.

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:21.630
Sorry, we already watched 
<i>Molly the Witch</i>, too.

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:27.390
No way!

00:12:27.750 --> 00:12:29.370
Shall we start dinner?

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:30.540
I'll help.

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:31.790
Me, too, then.

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:33.010
Thank you.

00:12:33.010 --> 00:12:35.180
Let's race to the kitchen, then.

00:12:35.180 --> 00:12:36.150
Hoy, sir!

00:12:42.770 --> 00:12:44.350
It looks delicious.

00:12:43.210 --> 00:12:43.840
Here.

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:44.780
Thanks.

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:08.930
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:10.180
Ow!

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:12.040
This is bad!

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:16.920
What's wrong?

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:19.570
A Gigamachinju showed up in the city.

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:21.690
A Gigamachinju?

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:23.760
It's headed our way.

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:24.960
Be calm.

00:13:25.640 --> 00:13:26.700
We're safe.

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:29.570
I've already set up a barrier.

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:33.950
It's weird, Kaikai-senpai doesn't 
seem any different from usual.

00:13:36.590 --> 00:13:40.340
Musashisakai Kai!

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:49.600
<b>Right</b>

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:49.600
<b>Left</b>

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:53.220
Guren Shoot!

00:13:56.980 --> 00:13:59.140
That's a bit too much firepower.

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:01.480
How?

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:04.460
How can you all be so okay with this?

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:06.180
This is wrong!

00:14:06.760 --> 00:14:08.600
It's not like we're in an anime!

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:10.930
"It's not like we're in an anime"?

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:12.520
This is great.

00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:14.600
Is there a problem?

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:17.620
You've been talking crazy since yesterday.

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:21.130
What has your soul been possessed by?

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:22.940
Get a grip, I'm begging you.

00:14:22.940 --> 00:14:24.160
Anime is anime.

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:25.260
It's not reality.

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:27.260
<i>You're</i> the ones being crazy.

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:30.970
Are you rejecting anime?

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:34.100
What a terrifying child!

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:39.350
I thought you loved the 
Anime Club more than anyone.

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:40.980
And yet...

00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:42.480
Wait a second.

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:44.280
What a terrifying child!

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:45.610
Arisu-chan!

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:50.300
Is it truly a love of anime if one 
doesn't accept every aspect of anime?

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:52.620
I'm done with you.

00:14:55.210 --> 00:14:56.220
I'm disappointed.

00:14:58.270 --> 00:14:59.500
Why?

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:18.390
Why is it suddenly sunset?!

00:15:23.430 --> 00:15:26.280
I'm done with you.

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:31.030
Are you rejecting anime?

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:38.290
<b>Autumn Wars</b>

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:40.040
<b>Replica</b>

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:50.080
What?

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:51.020
No.

00:15:51.020 --> 00:15:51.960
No.

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:53.680
No!

00:15:54.310 --> 00:15:56.650
Mii-chan, what's wrong?

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:01.370
Am I weird?

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:03.340
Am I not normal?

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:07.350
Is there something wrong with me?

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:08.940
Mii-chan...

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:10.970
Of course there isn't.

00:16:19.550 --> 00:16:21.430
Hang on just a little longer.

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:24.290
We're almost at the ending.

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:31.670
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:47.510
Morning.

00:16:47.510 --> 00:16:48.800
Good morning.

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:49.820
Morning.

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:50.680
Morning.

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:57.120
Weird, I feel like everyone's staring at me.

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:58.690
What do you expect?

00:17:00.170 --> 00:17:03.120
I heard you said you hate anime.

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:11.130
I never...

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:13.770
said that!

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:21.090
Good day.

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:41.610
Morning.

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:47.280
Aurora-senpai.

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:51.620
Could you please not call me by that name?

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:56.050
You're right that something's changed.

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:57.190
Senpai...

00:17:57.550 --> 00:18:01.430
I might not have noticed 
if you hadn't mentioned it.

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:03.790
Thank goodness.

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:07.300
I thought I was the one going crazy.

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.780
There must be a cause.

00:18:09.780 --> 00:18:10.690
A cause?

00:18:11.260 --> 00:18:14.640
A cause for all the impossible 
things that are happening.

00:18:15.170 --> 00:18:16.600
Can you think of anything?

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:19.350
Impossible things?

00:18:27.340 --> 00:18:28.830
It's all your doing, isn't it?

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:29.860
Huh?

00:18:29.860 --> 00:18:32.980
I knew it was weird... A talking cat!

00:18:33.770 --> 00:18:36.970
You're pointing that out <i>now</i>?

00:18:37.230 --> 00:18:40.970
When I first opened the door, there you were.

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:42.850
Indeed, thank you.

00:18:43.110 --> 00:18:45.950
And you told me not to open the door.

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:47.950
Everything's gotten weirder and weirder

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:51.180
since Nakano-senpai and the 
others started talking to you.

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:53.960
You must be the cause of all of this!

00:18:55.450 --> 00:18:57.720
Is that right?

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:02.150
Now, let's get to the bottom of everything.

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:06.870
W-Wait!

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:23.820
The door...

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:32.150
And now it's my turn!

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:37.900
Behold! Black Red Blue Yellow 
Golden Dragon! Summon!

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:46.980
Herpty herpty, derpty derpty, 
herpty herpty, derpty derpty...

00:19:46.980 --> 00:19:49.160
Arisu-chan! Miko-chan!

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:50.420
What?

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:08.330
Even me?

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:09.140
Anime?

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:11.920
The shackles have been broken.

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:13.060
Senpai.

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:17.570
With the Observer absent, 
order will be destroyed.

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:20.820
What are you talking about?

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:22.820
Who are you?!

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:24.490
Are you from the <i>other side</i>?

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:27.840
That's right.

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:29.310
The <i>anime</i> side.

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:31.190
Just like you.

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:33.160
Neko-senpai? An anime?

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:35.580
You're shocked at <i>me</i>?!

00:20:36.110 --> 00:20:40.090
This world will soon be engulfed in anime.

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:42.590
Engulfed?

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:44.470
Who do you work for?

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:51.480
He has come.

00:21:05.490 --> 00:21:08.530
New World Big Bang!

00:21:18.830 --> 00:21:19.770
Guys...

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:25.630
This is reality.

00:23:08.560 --> 00:23:12.550
Did we even talk anime today?

00:23:12.550 --> 00:23:16.610
The title <i>Anime-Gataris</i> means 
"Anime Talk," doesn't it?

00:23:16.610 --> 00:23:19.120
Wait, let's check the opening again.

00:23:21.350 --> 00:23:22.810
Yuicching!

00:23:23.700 --> 00:23:25.320
Yuicching...

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:27.450
Yuicching?!

00:23:29.140 --> 00:23:30.730
What a terrifying girl.

00:23:30.730 --> 00:23:33.060
What was once old is new again!

00:23:33.060 --> 00:23:36.890
And next, here comes the title card.

00:23:37.070 --> 00:23:40.390
"Anime-Non-Talk"?!
